      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The dam originally had two powerhouses built between 1933 and 1942, later expanded to 6,809 MW capacity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        15
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Grand_Coulee_Dam",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Visitor Center, opened in the late 1970s, displays geological samples, turbine models, and a theater about the dam’s history.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
